{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40522,"sections":[{"id":"script-20522","name":"原始脚本 20522","scripts":[20522],"start":0,"count":8}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20522:20522:1","scriptId":20522,"text":"","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20522:20522:4","scriptId":20522,"text":"箱子突然自己就打开了，从里面蹦出了一只原核体。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":49,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20522:20522:5","scriptId":20522,"text":"“哇！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":49,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":63,"speaker":"原核体-混乱","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20522:20522:6","scriptId":20522,"text":"“呜呜呜——”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":49,"right":63,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":50,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20522:20522:7","scriptId":20522,"text":"“吓我一跳，这箱子里怎么是原核体？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":63,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20522:20522:8","scriptId":20522,"text":"“可能是吃光了箱子里的补给品，然后想躲在里面伺机伏击那些来开箱子的人？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20522:20522:9","scriptId":20522,"text":"“可惜遇到的是我们，原核体倒是不错的泡虫饲料啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20522:20522:10","scriptId":20522,"text":"说完，补给箱里的原核体被一把揪了起来，在这里遇上埃普西隆意味着它大限将至……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
